Build a polished single-page app with:
- clean card layout
- sticky results panel on desktop
- mobile-first responsive layout
- high-contrast accessible form controls
- keyboard navigation
- expandable "Explain this" sections
- real-time updates after valid input changes
- a compact summary mode and a detailed breakdown mode

Recommended sections:
1. Case setup
2. Parent roles
3. Income and Schedule B adjustments
4. Parenting time
5. Additional expenses
6. Deviation estimates
7. High-income handling
8. Results
9. Save / Load / Copy summary

Required UX copy:
- call the result a "Georgia 2026 estimate"
- do not call it "official"
- show a visible disclaimer near results

